{"seq":32,"slug":"defi-protocol-design","title":"DeFi 协议设计","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# DeFi 协议设计\n\n去中心化金融（DeFi）协议在 2024-2026 年间经历了从「协议即产品」到「协议即平台」的范式跃迁。Uniswap v4 的 Hooks 把 AMM 变成了可编程流动性基础设施，Aave v4 的 Hub-and-Spoke 架构统一了碎片化借贷市场，Intent-Based 协议将交易执行从用户手中解放到竞争性 Solver 网络——这些变革的底层逻辑都指向同一个设计命题：如何在无许可、无信任的环境中构建资本高效且安全可组合的金融原语。\n\n本 hub 聚焦 DeFi 协议的**设计层**——从做市机制的数学原理到治理模型的博弈分析，而非合约层面的安全审计（后者属于兄弟 hub「智能合约安全」的范畴），也不重复金融科技基础 hub 中已覆盖的 AMM/借贷入门内容。我们假设读者已具备 Solidity 基本读写能力与 DeFi 使用经验，目标是帮助中高级开发者理解「为什么这样设计」以及「如何在已有原语之上构建新产品」。\n\n与兄弟 hub 的分工边界：「智能合约安全」hub 关注漏洞分类与审计工作流；「金融科技基础」hub 覆盖区块链原理与 DeFi 入门概念。本 hub 则深入协议的架构决策、激励设计与前沿演进。\n\n推荐学习路径：\n\n- 零基础路径：先完成「金融科技基础」hub → 本 hub 第一章（基础）→ 第二章（协议）→ 第三章（安全）→ 第四章（运营）\n- 有 DeFi 开发经验者：直接从第二章的 Uniswap v4 / Aave v4 前沿协议开始，按需回溯第一章的理论模型\n- 安全研究者：重点阅读第三章，结合「智能合约安全」hub 的审计实践\n\n前置知识：EVM 执行模型基础、Solidity 语法、基本的恒定乘积做市商概念、借贷协议的超额抵押原理。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"amm-mechanics","title":"AMM 做市机制与定价曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/foundations/amm-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lending-protocol-design","title":"借贷协议设计与利率模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/foundations/lending-protocol-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tokenomics-incentive-design","title":"代币经济学与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/foundations/tokenomics-incentive-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"protocols","title":"前沿协议篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"uniswap-v4-hooks","title":"Uniswap v4 Hooks 可编程流动性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/protocols/uniswap-v4-hooks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aave-v4-unified-liquidity","title":"Aave v4 统一流动性层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/protocols/aave-v4-unified-liquidity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intent-based-protocols","title":"Intent-Based 意图协议与 Solver 网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/protocols/intent-based-protocols"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"security","title":"安全与风控篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"defi-attack-vectors","title":"DeFi 攻击向量与防御模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security/defi-attack-vectors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"oracle-and-price-manipulation","title":"预言机安全设计与价格操纵防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security/oracle-and-price-manipulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"protocol-risk-management","title":"协议风险管理框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security/protocol-risk-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营与演进篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"restaking-mechanisms","title":"再质押机制与安全性经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations/restaking-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"governance-and-dao","title":"治理与 DAO 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations/governance-and-dao"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-chain-defi","title":"跨链 DeFi 与流动性统一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations/cross-chain-defi"}]}]}